{"unit_id":"SmileBuild__dsh-planchart#card-zh","repo":"SmileBuild/dsh-planchart","commit":"e63a6359ed43e6ae35cac505f10a8d128f53eba7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-planchart 是面向 DSH Web 的规划展示插件，提供工具和浏览器界面。Agent 可提交完整的项目步骤与框架图，步骤显示在可折叠的侧边面板，架构图显示在 PlanChart 中心标签页。用户可以查看阶段、状态和每步说明，缩放图表并下载 SVG 或 PNG；也能读取当前图表后继续修改。适合需要把项目计划、路线图或系统结构可视化的 DSH Web 用户。安装后无需额外密钥或外部服务配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:268-323","lib/client.js:6-10","lib/chart.js:206-217"]}
{"unit_id":"SmileBuild__dsh-planchart#card-en","repo":"SmileBuild/dsh-planchart","commit":"e63a6359ed43e6ae35cac505f10a8d128f53eba7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-planchart is a DSH Web plugin for visual project planning. Agents publish a complete plan; steps appear in a collapsible side panel and a framework diagram in a central tab. Users can track progress, zoom, export SVG or PNG, and read the current chart before revising it. No API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:268-323","lib/client.js:6-10","lib/chart.js:206-217"]}
