{"unit_id":"SmileBuild__dsh-planchart#feature-steps-panel","repo":"SmileBuild/dsh-planchart","commit":"e63a6359ed43e6ae35cac505f10a8d128f53eba7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-planchart 的功能「步骤进度面板」：将完整计划按阶段显示在侧边面板，并标出待办、进行中、完成或受阻状态；面板可折叠，状态和每步说明来自提交的步骤数据。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:6-9"]}
{"unit_id":"SmileBuild__dsh-planchart#feature-framework-tab","repo":"SmileBuild/dsh-planchart","commit":"e63a6359ed43e6ae35cac505f10a8d128f53eba7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-planchart 的功能「框架图标签页」：把项目框架呈现在中心 PlanChart 标签页，包含节点、分组和连接边；用户可缩放图表并下载为 SVG 或 PNG。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:6-13"]}
{"unit_id":"SmileBuild__dsh-planchart#feature-whole-chart-update","repo":"SmileBuild/dsh-planchart","commit":"e63a6359ed43e6ae35cac505f10a8d128f53eba7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-planchart 的功能「整体更新计划」：Agent 调用 planchart_set 提交标题、步骤和可选框架图，每次提交会替换当前图表；输入会规范化并检查步骤、节点和边的限制。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:268-290","lib/chart.js:206-217"]}
{"unit_id":"SmileBuild__dsh-planchart#feature-read-current","repo":"SmileBuild/dsh-planchart","commit":"e63a6359ed43e6ae35cac505f10a8d128f53eba7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-planchart 的功能「读取当前计划」：Agent 可调用 planchart_get 将本会话当前展示的图表读回文本，便于在上下文缺失时先查看现状再修改。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:300-324"]}
